                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8445cec-4624-32e9-8675-f1db850041aa",
                        "entry_id": "91a0eca5-2eda-3920-af3b-0b1b7380153d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "任何一種杜鵑花科植物",
                            "帚石楠（Calluna vulgaris）"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "57e57c4f-6123-4b39-8110-cecca01bcd01",
                                "sense_id": "d8445cec-4624-32e9-8675-f1db850041aa",
                                "text": "I was sitting by a path on a tussock between some bushes, whence I could overlook the path and a little valley to which it led down, and where nothing but ling and heather grew.",
                                "translation": "我坐在灌木丛间的一条小路边，俯瞰着小路延伸至的一个小山谷，那里除了石楠什么也没有。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63e2cef0-cf53-49fe-9f28-bdbf48eff615",
                                "sense_id": "d8445cec-4624-32e9-8675-f1db850041aa",
                                "text": "Partridges, enjoying their last weeks of security, rose whirring and clattering from among the ling.",
                                "translation": "鹧鸪正享受着最后几周的安全时光，它们从石楠丛中呼呼作响地飞起。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
